<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef uneven on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib and loin cuts steady to firm, while chuck cuts uneven. Select round cuts firm, while Choice round cuts weak. Beef trimmings firm on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>258 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 24 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>22 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =	97.12	 95.66	 93.25	 91.95</p>
<p>Change	    0.25	  0.20	  0.30	  0.12</p>
